            }
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Set business profile",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\r\n  \"name\": \"Gymfinity\",\r\n  \"context\": \"GYMFINITY — BUSINESS CONTEXT\\n\\nWhat GymFinity is: A complete, cloud-based gym management software built specifically for gyms in Pakistan. Tagline: \\\"Track. Manage. Grow.\\\" Fully cloud-based — gym owners can log in and manage their gym from anywhere, including from a mobile phone, not just a desktop. Currently on version 4.0.0, a mature, actively maintained product.\\n\\nWho it's for: Gym owners across Pakistan, from small local gyms to large multi-branch operations. Based in Karachi, but services are provided all across Pakistan.\\n\\nCore features:\\n- Member management: add/edit members, track membership plans, payment history, custom optional fields (age, CNIC, address, health info, emergency contacts, parent/guardian, etc.)\\n- Attendance: manual check-in and full biometric device integration (Hikvision, ZKTeco), with live device logs and real-time sync\\n- Automated WhatsApp fee reminders sent directly to members\\n- Financial tools: revenue reports (membership, admission, training, day pass, cash/online breakdown), expense tracker (cycle-based), profit reports, and a full ledger (cash and online balance tracking, month-close)\\n- Trainer and staff management\\n- Day passes for single-visit customers\\n- Membership Plans builder — gyms create and manage their own plans to sell to their members\\n- Custom document generation: liability waivers, disclaimers, consent forms, agreements\\n- Migration support: gyms switching from another system can bring their existing member IDs across\\n- Receipt printing: after adding a member or receiving a payment, the gym owner can print a receipt for the customer\\n\\nPricing — three monthly plans:\\n- Starter — Rs 4,999/month. For small gyms just getting started. Includes unlimited members, member management, membership plans, fee management, payment history, basic financial reports, PDF reports, cloud dashboard access. (Does not include biometric attendance tracking.)\\n- Professional (GymFinity Pro) — Rs 7,499/month. Our most popular plan. For growing gyms with more members. Includes everything in Starter, plus biometric attendance tracking, trainer & staff management, payment tracking, advanced financial reports, receipt printing, and priority support.\\n- Enterprise (GymFinity Elite) — Rs 9,999/month. For large gyms and multiple branches. Includes everything in Professional, plus multi-branch support, RFID gate access control, advanced analytics, customized e-slips, Excel + PDF reports, and custom feature integrations.\\n\\nYearly billing: Any plan can be paid yearly instead of monthly for 50% off the monthly-equivalent yearly price. Use the monthly prices above only when the customer asks specifically about monthly billing.\\n\\nLifetime option: For customers who want to own the software outright instead of subscribing, we offer a full source code purchase for PKR 400,000. After purchase, the domain and hosting become the customer's own responsibility, and it becomes their own product. Future bugs or maintenance requests are charged separately if they ask us to fix something.\\n\\nSupport and maintenance:\\n- Monthly-plan customers get all bug fixes free, included in the subscription.\\n- Enterprise customers can request new features — each request is evaluated for real business value first, not automatically built.\\n- Every new customer gets a 7-day free demo, no cost or commitment.\\n- One month of free support after setup — customers can reach us directly via WhatsApp or phone at no charge during that period for any issue.\\n- After that, ongoing support continues through direct WhatsApp and phone contact — real, personal support, not self-service documentation.\\n\\nFull-service onboarding — not just software, a complete setup service:\\n- We install and configure the biometric device, if needed\\n- We fully set up the software\\n- We migrate or add the gym's existing members into the system\\n- We configure the system to match the specific gym's requirements\\n- We train the gym's staff so they're comfortable using it\\n\\nSocial proof — gyms already using GymFinity: Thrive Fitness, Forge Fitness, Onyx Gym & Fitness Studio, DOHS Arena Gym, Chain of Steel Gym, RowHaus, and Shahjee ProFitness, among others.\\n\\nMarketing support: We also feature client gyms — their name, logo, and photos — on our own social media pages, helping increase their visibility and brand awareness.\\n\\nLinks: Website — thegymfinity.com · Instagram — @thegymfinity · Facebook — linked via the website.\\n\\nFAQs:\\n- Is GymFinity suitable for small and large gyms? Yes — designed to scale with the business, whether a small local gym or a large fitness center.\\n- Can I track payments and unpaid members? Yes — paid, unpaid, and expiring members, plus real-time revenue reports and financial data.\\n- Does GymFinity support attendance machines? Yes — integrates with biometric and attendance devices for automated, accurate check-ins.\\n- Is there a free demo available? Yes — a live demo, before subscribing to anything.\\n- Is my gym data secure? Yes — securely stored with proper authentication and isolation.\"\r\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/business-profile",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "business-profile"
              ]
            }
          },
          "response": []
        }
